# ==============================================================================
# Optional Environment Override File (/etc/lifeline/config.env)
# ==============================================================================
# Useful for per-machine provisioning (e.g., Ansible, cloud-init, or a tiny
# per-laptop file) when you want `/etc/lifeline/config.toml` and
# `/etc/lifeline/dhcp_hosts.csv` to be identical across all machines.
#
# Supported variables:
#   ETH_IP               Overrides [lan].eth_ip (CIDR or bare IP; bare IP -> /24)
#   ETH_IF               Overrides [interfaces].eth
#   WIFI_IF              Overrides [interfaces].wifi
#   ELECTION_PRIORITY    Overrides [election].priority (integer; lower wins)
#   ETH_IPV6_PREFIX      Overrides [lan].eth_ipv6_prefix
#   ETH_IPV6_HOST        Overrides [lan].eth_ipv6_host (default: matches eth_ip)
# ==============================================================================

# ETH_IP=192.168.9.24/24
# ELECTION_PRIORITY=100
